                                     "Sana Serif Hero display headline only. A weight-400 serif at 72px is the system\u0027s signature move: most AI brands shout with bold sans, Sana whispers with editorial type and lets the scale carry authority. The serif counterforms and bracket serifs give the wordmark a literary, humanist quality absent from typical product UI. `--font-sana-serif`",
